# Generated by mazapan (plugin {{ plugin }}): agent-ask [--selection] [FILE…]
# opens the Ask card about these (the selected text, else what was copied;
# files; a capture), to type the question; MAZAPAN_ASK set: that question,
# asked at once. The request goes as a file in the runtime folder, the
# person's alone.
d="${XDG_RUNTIME_DIR:-/tmp}/mazapan-ask"
mkdir -p "$d" && chmod 700 "$d" || exit 1
# What earlier questions were about (captures, notifications), gone after a day.
find "$d" -maxdepth 1 -type f -mmin +1440 -delete 2>/dev/null
if [ "$1" = "--selection" ]; then
  shift
  t=$(wl-paste --primary --no-newline 2>/dev/null)
  [ -n "$t" ] || t=$(wl-paste --no-newline --type text 2>/dev/null)
  if [ -n "$t" ]; then
    (umask 077; printf '%s' "$t" > "$d/selection.txt")
    set -- "$d/selection.txt" "$@"
  fi
fi
n=$#
for f in "$@"; do set -- "$@" "$(realpath -- "$f")"; done
shift "$n"
r="$d/r-$$.json"
jq -n --arg q "${MAZAPAN_ASK:-}" '{question: $q, files: $ARGS.positional}' --args "$@" > "$r" || exit 1
exec qs ipc -c mazapan call mazapan open ask "$r" >/dev/null
